  "_about": "MOB-R96 B — the demo's sample. A row with period and day_of_month is placed in a payday period: period 0 is the current one, -1 and -2 the two before it, on that day of the month (1–28, so it exists in every month); rows of the current period appear once their day has come. A row with offset_days is that many days from Kuwait's today (0 = today). Read by the demo (lib/demo) and by the API parity test (demo-parity.integration.test.ts); change an amount here and both sides move together.",
